tegers.py:1-17,36-45,80-90` — Preserve the safe range, deterministic inexact fixture, liveness anchor, and exact digit assertion. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_fsck_structured_326f.py:1-18,120-132,240-245` — Preserve structured completed results, true failures, and separate recovery output. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_http_transport.py:405-414,454-464,499-503,543-548` — Preserve instrument-before-offload, stop-intake, drain-before-exit, and short uvicorn backstop. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_js_safe_integers.py:1-22,170-180,234-243` — Preserve JS-safe encoding, schema allowance, and agreement between response halves. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_list_read_surface.py:1-17,193-201,259-265,283-304,342-349,421-428` — Preserve lean-field exclusions, wire-size accounting, hard refusal, and valid remedies. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_push_status.py:1-16` — Preserve that caller-visible results must report delivery state because server stderr is invisible. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_stateless_transport.py:21-35` — Preserve that blue-green routing requires stateless HTTP sessions and why graceful retirement cannot rescue old session IDs. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_plan_review_attestation_facades.py:1-15,157-160` — Preserve retryability parity and sidecar-loss recovery behavior. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/facades/test_verify_completion_facades.py:1-20` — Preserve the CLI/MCP scope, offline seam, exit/schema contract, and default gating. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/facades/test_attestation_parity_heldout_2e16.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_programmatic.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_central_mount_gate_ad9f.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_cli_argparse.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_cli_js_safe_integers.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_fsck_structured_326f.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_http_transport.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_js_safe_integers.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_list_read_surface.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_push_status.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_stateless_transport.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_plan_review_attestation_facades.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_verify_completion_facades.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/interfaces/facades/test_attestation_parity_heldout_2e16.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_programmatic.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/facades/test_cent